# The API origin, bundled into the production build.
#
# This is public by design and is the only environment value the app reads. It
# is NOT a secret: the repo is public and this string ships to every browser.
#
# This is the STAGING Worker. Production is a manual promotion until P15, and
# staging is the only origin that exists, so it is what the app points at. P15
# swaps this for `svenska-kort-api.seth-7b6.workers.dev` as part of the cutover.
#
# Setting it is not the cutover: nothing in the app reads `hasApi()` yet, so at
# P01 this value only makes the origin available to the code P03 onwards adds.
VITE_API_BASE=https://svenska-kort-api-staging.seth-7b6.workers.dev
